From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: m7642 <m7642@local>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 00:37:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] arm64: mstar: note that the built-in DTB needs "make
 dtbs" first

m7642-dtb.S .incbin's the compiled board DTB, so it has to exist before the
kernel is linked.  A kbuild prerequisite was tried and dropped: the dtc rules
live in the dts sub-make, so a prerequisite declared here is "no rule to make
target".  Clean out-of-tree builds therefore need: make dtbs Image
---
 arch/arm64/kernel/Makefile | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/kernel/Makefile b/arch/arm64/kernel/Makefile
index b4268f2ef..2cfff51d6 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/kernel/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/kernel/Makefile
@@ -90,5 +90,10 @@ endif
 
 obj-$(CONFIG_MSTAR_M7642_BUILTIN_DTB)	+= m7642-dtb.o
 
+# m7642-dtb.S .incbin's the compiled board DTB, so `make dtbs` has to run before
+# the kernel is linked -- build with "make dtbs Image".  A kbuild dependency was
+# tried and dropped: the dtc rules live in the dts sub-make, so a prerequisite
+# here is "no rule to make target" (2026-11-23).
+
 # for cleaning
 subdir- += vdso vdso32
